         ic_restaurant, ic_home, ic_explore, ic_favorite, ic_person) are not
         included as files. Add each one the fast way:
           Android Studio > right-click res > New > Vector Asset > Clip Art
           > search the Material icon name (e.g. "beach_access" for ic_beach,
           "castle" for ic_castle, "water_drop" for ic_waterfall, "pets" for
