              Pexels — see the links given alongside this file) and drag it
              into res/drawable with that exact file name, or
           b) Replace android:src with a placeholder and load the real photo
              at runtime using Glide or Coil, e.g.:
                Glide.with(context).load(imageUrl).into(imageView);

      3. This file assumes the Material Components library is already in your
